    "title": "Bemidji State University Leaps Ahead in U.S. News & World Report Rankings - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Red Lake Nation News ,\n1 days ago BEMIDJI, Minnesota — Bemidji State University has received its highest standing in the U.S. News & World Report Best Colleges rankings since 2010. The 2026 rankings, released September 23, show Bemidji State tied for 71st among all public universities in the Midwest region and 23rd among the region’s public institutions. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
